  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里似乎只是条死路……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 88 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}那边是死路……\n这边也是死路……\n总觉得根本没在往前走啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊——\n好想快点见到小千鸟……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 11 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}您这忧愁可真高雅啊。\n简直像徒手逆着捋我的神经一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}别理他。\n继续前进。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 84 08}你们俩还真无情啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9A 08}那真田学长又怎么样？\n面对追随者的示好，\n现在也还坚持彻底无视吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A5 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦！？\n真田学长，您还有追随者啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0051",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，说起来。\n好像是有追随者吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 09}是她们自己跟上来的。\n说实话，很困扰。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A7 02}感觉自己的神经被人戴着指虎，\n狠狠揍了一拳……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不理她们，就立刻吵闹。\n还说每周至少想见一次。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}却对这段时间流失的肌肉\n不闻不问。\n真要认真陪她们，身体就会退步。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0082",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……你不也这么觉得吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}完全赞同{F5 47 02 01 01 01 03 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}只是还没遇到对的人{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}找个爱健身的女生吧{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 09}对吧？\n至少，如果是个休息日安排\n和我差不多的女生，倒可以交往……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊——感觉找不到啊……\n男生里也没几个这样的人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8F 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}是、是吗？\n要是有女生能跟上我的训练，\n倒也可以交往……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊——感觉找不到啊……\n男生里也没几个这样的人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8E 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}还、还有这种人！？\n在哪里，健身房吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊，不过她们健身，\n多半是为了健康之类的。\n可没真田学长这么拼命……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_415.bf.json:19:0",
